{"event": "answer", "data": {"question": "Leak tester failing the master part, VT-018", "triage": {"asset_id": "LT-01", "alarm_code": "VT-018", "failure_mode_id": "FM-FIXTURE-SEAL-WEAR", "intent": "troubleshoot", "safety_critical": 0.42, "confidence": {"machine": 1.0, "alarm": 1.0, "root_cause": 0.46, "intent": 0.99, "safety_critical": 0.5800000000000001}, "status": "confirm", "chips": [{"field": "root_cause", "value": "FM-FIXTURE-SEAL-WEAR", "label": "fixture seal wear", "p": 0.46}, {"field": "root_cause", "value": "FM-PRESSURE-SENSOR-DRIFT", "label": "pressure sensor drift", "p": 0.31}, {"field": "safety_critical", "value": "no", "label": "No hazard", "p": 0.5800000000000001}, {"field": "safety_critical", "value": "yes", "label": "Yes, isolation or a hazard", "p": 0.42}], "reason": "Not sure about: root_cause, safety_critical."}, "summary": "Worn fixture seals are the most likely cause of VT-018 on LT-01. First check for flattened seals and fixture hissing, and whether leak readings are high on every part. Pressure sensor drift remains a possible alternative, especially if the reference reading is off.", "causes": [{"asset_id": "LT-01", "failure_mode_id": "FM-FIXTURE-SEAL-WEAR", "name": "fixture seal wear", "likelihood": 0.7, "support": 3, "of_total": 3, "support_model": 3, "matches_symptom": false, "citations": [{"doc_path": "manuals/VT-LD20_manual_EN.pdf", "page": 3, "chunk_id": "DOC-8f7d2f45-3-2", "quote": "worn fixture seals (most likely)"}], "path": [{"src": "VT-018", "rel": "INDICATES", "dst": "FM-FIXTURE-SEAL-WEAR"}, {"src": "FM-FIXTURE-SEAL-WEAR", "rel": "AFFECTS", "dst": "LT-01-FIXTURE"}, {"src": "LT-01", "rel": "HAS_COMPONENT", "dst": "LT-01-FIXTURE"}]}, {"asset_id": "LT-01", "failure_mode_id": "FM-PRESSURE-SENSOR-DRIFT", "name": "pressure sensor drift", "likelihood": 0.3, "support": 0, "of_total": 3, "support_model": 0, "matches_symptom": false, "citations": [{"doc_path": "manuals/VT-LD20_manual_EN.pdf", "page": 3, "chunk_id": "DOC-8f7d2f45-3-2", "quote": "pressure sensor drift (possible)"}], "path": [{"src": "VT-018", "rel": "INDICATES", "dst": "FM-PRESSURE-SENSOR-DRIFT"}, {"src": "FM-PRESSURE-SENSOR-DRIFT", "rel": "AFFECTS", "dst": "LT-01-PRSSENS"}, {"src": "LT-01", "rel": "HAS_COMPONENT", "dst": "LT-01-PRSSENS"}]}], "fix": {"procedure_id": "PROC-LT-02", "title": "Replace fixture seals", "steps": ["Close the air supply and apply lockout and tagout on the tester pneumatic valve.", "Remove the fixture plate and both test seals.", "Fit two SEAL-FIX-30 seals and refit the plate.", "Remove the lockout and run three master parts to confirm the leak rate is within limits."], "requires_loto": true, "est_minutes": 45, "manual_ref": "4.2", "citations": [{"doc_path": "manuals/VT-LD20_manual_EN.pdf", "page": 5, "chunk_id": "DOC-8f7d2f45-5-5", "quote": "Plant ref: PROC-LT-02 | Lockout required: yes | Time: 45 min"}, {"doc_path": "manuals/VT-LD20_manual_EN.pdf", "page": 4, "chunk_id": "DOC-8f7d2f45-4-3", "quote": "(plant ref PROC-LT-02)"}], "path": [{"src": "FM-FIXTURE-SEAL-WEAR", "rel": "RESOLVED_BY", "dst": "PROC-LT-02"}]}, "other_fixes": [{"procedure_id": "PROC-LT-01", "title": "Recalibrate pressure sensor", "steps": ["Load the master part and start Calibration, then Reference, from the tester menu.", "Compare the reading with the reference gauge.", "Apply the offset if the difference is under 2 percent, otherwise replace the sensor with SENS-PRS-10.", "Run three master parts and confirm they pass."], "requires_loto": false, "est_minutes": 30, "manual_ref": "4.1", "citations": [{"doc_path": "manuals/VT-LD20_manual_EN.pdf", "page": 5, "chunk_id": "DOC-8f7d2f45-5-4", "quote": "Plant ref: PROC-LT-01 | Lockout required: no | Time: 30 min"}, {"doc_path": "manuals/VT-LD20_manual_EN.pdf", "page": 4, "chunk_id": "DOC-8f7d2f45-4-3", "quote": "(plant ref PROC-LT-01)"}], "path": [{"src": "FM-PRESSURE-SENSOR-DRIFT", "rel": "RESOLVED_BY", "dst": "PROC-LT-01"}]}], "parts": [{"part_no": "SEAL-FIX-30", "description": "Leak test fixture seal 30 mm", "qty": 2, "qty_on_hand": 8, "bin": "E-01", "lead_time_days": 7, "stock_as_of": "2026-10-15", "enough": true, "citations": [{"doc_path": "manuals/VT-LD20_manual_EN.pdf", "page": 5, "chunk_id": "DOC-8f7d2f45-5-5", "quote": "SEAL-FIX-30\nLeak test fixture seal 30 mm\n2"}, {"doc_path": "inventory/spares_2026-10.xlsx", "page": null, "chunk_id": null, "quote": "SEAL-FIX-30 | Leak test fixture seal 30 mm | 8 pcs | pc | E-01 | 1 wks | 22"}], "path": [{"src": "PROC-LT-02", "rel": "REQUIRES", "dst": "SEAL-FIX-30"}]}], "breakdowns": [{"asset_id": "LT-01", "incident_id": "INC-2026-029", "date": "2026-06-14", "shift": "C", "downtime_min": 170, "technician": "AP", "symptom_text": "fill takes too long, seals look flattened", "resolution_text": "Repl fixture seals", "root_cause_id": "FM-FIXTURE-SEAL-WEAR", "parts_used": {"O-RING-NBR-30": 1, "SEAL-FIX-30": 2}, "citations": [{"doc_path": "maintenance/maint_log_export_2026.csv", "page": null, "chunk_id": null, "quote": "14/06/2026,leak tester,\"VT-018: fill takes too long, seals look flattened\",Repl fixture seals,ORINGNBR30 x1; fixture seal x2,AP,170,WO-5999"}, {"doc_path": "handovers/shift notes 14 Jun night.txt", "page": null, "chunk_id": "DOC-96468c6a-0-0", "quote": "- LT1 stopped 2341 w/ VT018, fill takes too lnog, seals look flattened. Repl fixtuer seals (ORINGNBR30, SEAL FIX 30 x2), test run ok. Down approx 3h."}], "path": [{"src": "INC-2026-029", "rel": "OCCURRED_ON", "dst": "LT-01"}, {"src": "INC-2026-029", "rel": "TRIGGERED_BY", "dst": "VT-018"}, {"src": "INC-2026-029", "rel": "ROOT_CAUSE", "dst": "FM-FIXTURE-SEAL-WEAR"}, {"src": "INC-2026-029", "rel": "USED", "dst": "O-RING-NBR-30"}, {"src": "INC-2026-029", "rel": "USED", "dst": "SEAL-FIX-30"}]}, {"asset_id": "LT-01", "incident_id": "INC-2026-013", "date": "2026-04-30", "shift": "B", "downtime_min": 150, "technician": "Nur Aisyah", "symptom_text": "leak rate high on every part, fixture hissing", "resolution_text": "Repl fixture seals", "root_cause_id": "FM-FIXTURE-SEAL-WEAR", "parts_used": {"SEAL-FIX-30": 2}, "citations": [{"doc_path": "maintenance/maint_log_export_2026.csv", "page": null, "chunk_id": null, "quote": "2026-04-30,LT-01,\"leak rate high on every part, fixture hissing\",Repl fixture seals,fixture seal x2,Nur Aisyah,approx 150,WO-4247"}, {"doc_path": "handovers/Handover_20260430_B.txt", "page": null, "chunk_id": "DOC-7b31fde2-0-0", "quote": "- LT-01 stopped 1915 w/ VT018, leak rate high on every part, fixture hisisng. Repl fixture seals (SEAL FIX 30 x2), running ok now. Down 145 min."}], "path": [{"src": "INC-2026-013", "rel": "OCCURRED_ON", "dst": "LT-01"}, {"src": "INC-2026-013", "rel": "TRIGGERED_BY", "dst": "VT-018"}, {"src": "INC-2026-013", "rel": "ROOT_CAUSE", "dst": "FM-FIXTURE-SEAL-WEAR"}, {"src": "INC-2026-013", "rel": "USED", "dst": "SEAL-FIX-30"}]}, {"asset_id": "LT-01", "incident_id": "INC-2026-010", "date": "2026-04-26", "shift": null, "downtime_min": 200, "technician": "Siew Ling", "symptom_text": "fill takes too long, seals look flattened", "resolution_text": "Repl fixture seals", "root_cause_id": "FM-FIXTURE-SEAL-WEAR", "parts_used": {"SEAL-FIX-30": 2}, "citations": [{"doc_path": "maintenance/maint_log_export_2026.csv", "page": null, "chunk_id": null, "quote": "26/04/2026,VT station,\"VT18: fill takes too long, seals look flattened\",Repl fixture seals,SEALFIX30 x2,Siew Ling,200,WO-3841"}, {"doc_path": "maintenance/maint_log_export_2026.csv", "page": null, "chunk_id": null, "quote": "2026-04-26,VT station,\"VT18: fill takes too long, seals look flattened\",Repl fixture seals,SEALFIX30 x2,Siew Ling,220,WO-3841"}], "path": [{"src": "INC-2026-010", "rel": "OCCURRED_ON", "dst": "LT-01"}, {"src": "INC-2026-010", "rel": "TRIGGERED_BY", "dst": "VT-018"}, {"src": "INC-2026-010", "rel": "ROOT_CAUSE", "dst": "FM-FIXTURE-SEAL-WEAR"}, {"src": "INC-2026-010", "rel": "USED", "dst": "SEAL-FIX-30"}]}], "history": null, "stock": [], "safety": {"required": true, "reason": "PROC-LT-02 requires lockout and tagout.", "procedure_ids": ["PROC-LT-02"], "text": "Close the compressed air supply and fit your personal lock and tag on the tester pneumatic valve. Compressed air stays in the lines and in the fixture after the supply is closed, so vent the lines and check that the gauge reads zero before you open any fitting. Verify zero energy before you start. Apply lockout and tagout before starting. Verify zero energy.", "citations": [{"doc_path": "manuals/VT-LD20_manual_EN.pdf", "page": 2, "chunk_id": "DOC-8f7d2f45-2-1", "quote": "Close the compressed air supply and fit your personal lock and tag on the tester pneumatic valve. Compressed air stays in the lines and in the fixture after the supply is closed, so vent the lines and check that the gauge reads zero before you open any fitting. Verify zero energy before you start."}, {"doc_path": "manuals/VT-LD20_manual_EN.pdf", "page": 5, "chunk_id": "DOC-8f7d2f45-5-5", "quote": "WARNING: Apply lockout and tagout before starting. Verify zero energy."}]}, "claims": [{"id": "claim-1", "text": "VT-018 means the master-part leak rate is above limit; the manual ranks worn fixture seals ahead of pressure sensor drift.", "citation_ids": ["C1"], "verdict": "supported", "p": 0.99, "support": 1.0, "reason": null}, {"id": "claim-2", "text": "High leak readings on every part and fixture hissing point to worn fixture seals.", "citation_ids": ["C3"], "verdict": "supported", "p": 0.99, "support": 1.0, "reason": null}, {"id": "claim-3", "text": "Flattened seals were reported alongside slow filling in past seal-related breakdowns.", "citation_ids": ["C4", "C8", "C10"], "verdict": "supported", "p": 0.96, "support": 1.0, "reason": null}, {"id": "claim-4", "text": "Good parts failing with an off-reference reading points to pressure sensor drift; comparing the reading with the reference gauge is the manual's check.", "citation_ids": ["C3", "C17"], "verdict": "supported", "p": 0.75, "support": 0.98, "reason": null}], "unverified": [], "citations": {"C1": {"doc_path": "manuals/VT-LD20_manual_EN.pdf", "page": 3, "chunk_id": "DOC-8f7d2f45-3-2", "quote": "2 Alarm table\nThe control shows these codes. Likely causes are listed in order of likelihood.\nCode\nMessage\nSeverity\nLikely causes\nAction\nVT-012\nReference pressure out of tolerance\nwarning\npressure sensor drift (most likely)\nSee 4.1 Recalibrate pressure sensor\n(plant ref PROC-LT-01)\nVT-018\nLeak rate above limit on master part\ncritical\nworn fixture seals (most likely)\npressure sensor drift (possible)\nSee 4.2 Replace fixture seals\n(plant ref PROC-LT-02)\nSee 4.1 Recalibrate pressure sensor\n(plant ref PROC-LT-01)\nVT-021\nFill time exceeded\nwarning\nworn fixture seals (most likely)\nSee 4.2 Replace fixture seals\n(plant ref PROC-LT-02)"}, "C3": {"doc_path": "manuals/VT-LD20_manual_EN.pdf", "page": 4, "chunk_id": "DOC-8f7d2f45-4-3", "quote": "3 Troubleshooting table\nFind the symptom, then follow the remedy.\nSymptom\nProbable cause\nRemedy\ngood parts failing leak test, reference off\npressure sensor drift\nSee 4.1 Recalibrate pressure sensor\n(plant ref PROC-LT-01)\nleak rate high on every part, fixture hissing\nworn fixture seals\nSee 4.2 Replace fixture seals\n(plant ref PROC-LT-02)"}, "C4": {"doc_path": "maintenance/maint_log_export_2026.csv", "page": null, "chunk_id": null, "quote": "14/06/2026,leak tester,\"VT-018: fill takes too long, seals look flattened\",Repl fixture seals,ORINGNBR30 x1; fixture seal x2,AP,170,WO-5999"}, "C8": {"doc_path": "maintenance/maint_log_export_2026.csv", "page": null, "chunk_id": null, "quote": "26/04/2026,VT station,\"VT18: fill takes too long, seals look flattened\",Repl fixture seals,SEALFIX30 x2,Siew Ling,200,WO-3841"}, "C10": {"doc_path": "maintenance/maint_log_export_2026.csv", "page": null, "chunk_id": null, "quote": "23/04/2026,LT-01,\"fill takes too long, seals look flattened\",Repl fixture seals,SEALFIX30 x2,Siew Ling,95,WO-3685"}, "C17": {"doc_path": "manuals/VT-LD20_manual_EN.pdf", "page": 5, "chunk_id": "DOC-8f7d2f45-5-4", "quote": "4 Procedures\n4.1 Recalibrate pressure sensor\nPlant ref: PROC-LT-01 | Lockout required: no | Time: 30 min\nNo isolation needed. Work from the HMI only.\n1. Load the master part and start Calibration, then Reference, from the tester menu.\n2. Compare the reading with the reference gauge.\n3. Apply the offset if the difference is under 2 percent, otherwise replace the sensor with SENS-PRS-10.\n4. Run three master parts and confirm they pass.\nParts required: none."}}, "path": [{"src": "VT-018", "rel": "INDICATES", "dst": "FM-FIXTURE-SEAL-WEAR"}, {"src": "FM-FIXTURE-SEAL-WEAR", "rel": "AFFECTS", "dst": "LT-01-FIXTURE"}, {"src": "LT-01", "rel": "HAS_COMPONENT", "dst": "LT-01-FIXTURE"}, {"src": "VT-018", "rel": "INDICATES", "dst": "FM-PRESSURE-SENSOR-DRIFT"}, {"src": "FM-PRESSURE-SENSOR-DRIFT", "rel": "AFFECTS", "dst": "LT-01-PRSSENS"}, {"src": "LT-01", "rel": "HAS_COMPONENT", "dst": "LT-01-PRSSENS"}, {"src": "FM-FIXTURE-SEAL-WEAR", "rel": "RESOLVED_BY", "dst": "PROC-LT-02"}, {"src": "FM-PRESSURE-SENSOR-DRIFT", "rel": "RESOLVED_BY", "dst": "PROC-LT-01"}, {"src": "PROC-LT-02", "rel": "REQUIRES", "dst": "SEAL-FIX-30"}, {"src": "INC-2026-029", "rel": "OCCURRED_ON", "dst": "LT-01"}, {"src": "INC-2026-029", "rel": "TRIGGERED_BY", "dst": "VT-018"}, {"src": "INC-2026-029", "rel": "ROOT_CAUSE", "dst": "FM-FIXTURE-SEAL-WEAR"}, {"src": "INC-2026-029", "rel": "USED", "dst": "O-RING-NBR-30"}, {"src": "INC-2026-029", "rel": "USED", "dst": "SEAL-FIX-30"}, {"src": "INC-2026-013", "rel": "OCCURRED_ON", "dst": "LT-01"}, {"src": "INC-2026-013", "rel": "TRIGGERED_BY", "dst": "VT-018"}, {"src": "INC-2026-013", "rel": "ROOT_CAUSE", "dst": "FM-FIXTURE-SEAL-WEAR"}, {"src": "INC-2026-013", "rel": "USED", "dst": "SEAL-FIX-30"}, {"src": "INC-2026-010", "rel": "OCCURRED_ON", "dst": "LT-01"}, {"src": "INC-2026-010", "rel": "TRIGGERED_BY", "dst": "VT-018"}, {"src": "INC-2026-010", "rel": "ROOT_CAUSE", "dst": "FM-FIXTURE-SEAL-WEAR"}, {"src": "INC-2026-010", "rel": "USED", "ds